  "_comment": "Working machinery: the parts a player assembles into something that runs. What soulhome:workshop is built out of, and empty until a mod that adds machines is installed - every entry is {\"id\": ..., \"required\": false}, so the tag loads either way and simply never matches. Create is what ships here; any other tech mod is a data pack away from a workshop of its own, with no Java change. Casings, girders and framed glass are soulhome:structural instead, and toolboxes and vaults are soulhome:storage, so a wall or a chest does not read as a machine.",
